over:bg-brand-cyan hover:text-brand-navy","aria-label":"Contact sales — Enterprise","href":"/contact?plan=founder_enterprise"},"Contact sales"]]],["P",{"class":"mt-10 text-center text-xs text-brand-ink-muted"},"Prices in Australian dollars, GST-exclusive. GST added at checkout for Australian customers once Auschain PTY LTD (ABN 79 659 615 111) crosses the A$75,000 turnover threshold. ","Card required to prevent abuse. Cancel anytime. Email reminder 48h before we charge."],["P",{"class":"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl border-t border-white/5 pt-4 text-center text-xs text-brand-ink-muted"},"Not financial advice. Plan information is general in nature and does not account for your objectives or financial situation — seek independent advice before subscribing."]]]],["SECTION",{"aria-label":"Frequently asked questions","class":"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-12 pt-4"},["SECTION",{"id":"faq","class":"w-full py-24 px-6 md:px-10 bg-brand-navy"},["DIV",{"class":"mx-auto max-w-5xl"},["DIV",{"class":"text-center mb-14"},["P",{"class":"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-gold mb-3"},"Frequently Asked"],["H2",{"class":"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-ink"},"Questions we hear from founders and investors"],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-brand-ink-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto"},"Everything you need to know about trials, billing, equity, and compliance."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"},["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"What happens after the 7-day free trial?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Your plan auto-charges on Day 8 unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the trial ends. We send email reminders at T-3, T-1, and T-0 so you always know what's coming."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"Is a credit card required to start the trial?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Yes — your card is saved securely via a Stripe Setup Intent (PCI-DSS Level 1). No charge is placed until Day 8, and you can cancel any time from Billing settings."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"Can I switch plans mid-trial?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Yes. Upgrades and downgrades are available anytime from Billing settings. Any charges are prorated based on remaining days in the cycle."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"What's the refund policy?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"We offer a 7-day money-back guarantee on your first paid month, no questions asked. Contact support and we'll process the refund within 3 business days."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"What does \"equity in lieu of cash\" mean?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Enterprise-tier customers may negotiate paying part of their subscription (typically 5–10%) via equity through a separate off-platform legal agreement. All equity arrangements are subject to counsel review — Request a Call to discuss terms."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"Do digital shares issued via BlockID count as real securities?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"No. Digital shares on BlockID are cap-table records mirrored to a blockchain for tamper-evidence and audit trail. Your ASIC register remains the source of truth. Any securities-adjacent workflow is flagged for legal review before execution."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"How do you handle GST?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"For Australian customers, 10% GST is added at checkout once we cross the A$75K annual turnover threshold. Tax is calculated and split automatically via Stripe Tax and appears on your itemized invoice."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"Can I switch segment (e.g., from Founder to Investor)?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Yes. Switching segment triggers a short re-onboarding step to configure the right dashboards and workflows. For enterprise multi-tenant setups (running multiple segments in one account), contact support."]]],["P",{"class":"mt-10 text-center text-xs text-brand-ink-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto"},"Information provided on this page is general in nature and does not constitute financial, legal, or tax advice. Consult a licensed professional before making decisions about securities, equity, or tax treatment. BlockID.au is operated by Auschain PTY LTD (ACN 659 615 111)."]]]],["SECTION",{"aria-labelledby":"_S_1_","class":"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-12 sm:py-16"},["DIV",{"class":"rounded-3xl border border-[var(--fintech-border)] bg-[var(--fintech-bg-elevated)] p-8 sm:p-10"},["P",{"class":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--fintech-accent)]"},"Enterprise"],["H2",{"id":"_S_1_","class":"mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--fintech-ink)] sm:text-3xl"},"Need custom pricing or equity-in-lieu?"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-8"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-start gap-6 text-center sm:items-center"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 h-10 w-10 text-[var(--fintech-accent)]","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M10 12h4"}],["path",{"d":"M10 8h4"}],["path",{"d":"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"}],["path",{"d":"M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"}],["path",{"d":"M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"}]],["P",{"class":"max-w-xl text-[var(--fintech-ink-muted)]"},"Enterprise multi-entity plans with SSO, API access, dedicated CSM, or our compliance-gated equity-for-solution arrangement (5–10% equity in lieu of cash)."]]]]],["SECTION",{"aria-l